            "required": true,
            "notes": "Capture the native JSON viewer for a real published homepage. Use its normal keyboard-operated pretty-print control; no HTML response wrapper. Retain actual X-Capell-Api-Version, X-Capell-Cache-Tags and ETag proof from tests/Browser/api-native-response-contract.mjs alongside the shared-runner evidence. Require real content and strong-validator304 semantics.",
